>
>Yes.  Also forbid wishing for Quest artifacts.

  A healer could have the +7 Mitre of Holiness, the Eye of 
Aethopica, a robe, and one thousand mana points, and the healer
still couldn't advance spell skills in any school except healing.

  Any non-Valkyrie could have gauntlets of power and Mjollnir, 
but Mjollnir still wouldn't return to their hand when thrown.

  A non-knight with the Magic Mirror of Merlin wouldn't get
double damage to the magic missile spell.


  Spell casting abilities differentiate characters, if you let
them.  If you won't let spell casting make a difference, nothing
can force you to differentiate characters.

