  There's a bigger problem here than I think you realize.  Right
now a skilled player who plays carefully can ascend without great
weapons, AC, etc.  E.g.: speed ascenders.

  Nethack actually seems geared towards that kind of player.
Look at guaranteed stuff in Vlad's Tower:

  A long sword, a lock pick, an elven cloak, a blindfold,
an amulet of life saving, an amulet of strangulation, a pair of 
water walking boots, a crystal plate mail, and a spellbook of 
invisibility.


  Only the amulet of life-saving would be useful to most players
when they get there.  But most players are also overpowered when 
they get there.   (Like me.  That's all stuff I'd prefer to find
on dungeon level one.  But I'm not a careful player.)



